    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>\ud83d\udd25 Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Turbojunk on Steroids</strong><br>Boost with turbines, overdrives, and explosive upgrades. Not just vehicles \u2014 real weapons on wheels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Boss Fights Included!</strong><br>Face deadly bosses in a story-driven campaign and prove who's king of the Wasteland.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Combat Racing</strong><br>Ram, shoot, blow up your enemies. This is war, not a race.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Upgrade &amp; Customize</strong><br>From brakes to monster turbo \u2014 build your perfect destruction machine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Dynamic Tracks</strong><br>Diverse environments with weather and terrain that affect how you drive: day/night cycles, fog, rain and more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Modes for Every Player</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Campaign \u2013 ~8 hours of explosive gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PvE Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local Split-Screen &amp; Online PvP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick Race Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena Mode \u2013 survive and destroy everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/5345b066bc2feaa83678ac9724335ede.poster.avif?t=1753370494\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/5345b066bc2feaa83678ac9724335ede.webm?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/5345b066bc2feaa83678ac9724335ede.mp4?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Who is this game for?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turbo Sloths is made for fans of:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twisted Metal, Crossout, FlatOut, SnowRunner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tuning and upgrading powerful vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Racing where you destroy, not dodge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore, chaotic fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story modes with epic boss battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcac <strong>What players are saying</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cIt\u2019s Mad Max with turbo boosters and attitude.\u201d<br>\u201cA game that embraces madness.\u201d<br>\u201cHaven\u2019t felt this kind of rush since FlatOut.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/7d2d36e2fb4b8f612c6273828bd0ab04.poster.avif?t=1753370494\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/7d2d36e2fb4b8f612c6273828bd0ab04.webm?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/7d2d36e2fb4b8f612c6273828bd0ab04.mp4?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Ready to race?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget what you know about racing.<br>Build your monster. Hit the track. Leave craters behind.<br>Turbo Sloths is waiting!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/b8e9c38116e0e92ed210183702dcad24.poster.avif?t=1753370494\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/b8e9c38116e0e92ed210183702dcad24.webm?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/b8e9c38116e0e92ed210183702dcad24.mp4?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>\ud83d\udd25 Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Turbojunk on Steroids</strong><br>Boost with turbines, overdrives, and explosive upgrades. Not just vehicles \u2014 real weapons on wheels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Boss Fights Included!</strong><br>Face deadly bosses in a story-driven campaign and prove who's king of the Wasteland.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Combat Racing</strong><br>Ram, shoot, blow up your enemies. This is war, not a race.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Upgrade &amp; Customize</strong><br>From brakes to monster turbo \u2014 build your perfect destruction machine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Dynamic Tracks</strong><br>Diverse environments with weather and terrain that affect how you drive: day/night cycles, fog, rain and more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Modes for Every Player</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Campaign \u2013 ~8 hours of explosive gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PvE Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local Split-Screen &amp; Online PvP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick Race Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena Mode \u2013 survive and destroy everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/5345b066bc2feaa83678ac9724335ede.poster.avif?t=1753370494\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/5345b066bc2feaa83678ac9724335ede.webm?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/5345b066bc2feaa83678ac9724335ede.mp4?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Who is this game for?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turbo Sloths is made for fans of:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twisted Metal, Crossout, FlatOut, SnowRunner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tuning and upgrading powerful vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Racing where you destroy, not dodge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore, chaotic fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story modes with epic boss battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcac <strong>What players are saying</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cIt\u2019s Mad Max with turbo boosters and attitude.\u201d<br>\u201cA game that embraces madness.\u201d<br>\u201cHaven\u2019t felt this kind of rush since FlatOut.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/7d2d36e2fb4b8f612c6273828bd0ab04.poster.avif?t=1753370494\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/7d2d36e2fb4b8f612c6273828bd0ab04.webm?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/7d2d36e2fb4b8f612c6273828bd0ab04.mp4?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Ready to race?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget what you know about racing.<br>Build your monster. Hit the track. Leave craters behind.<br>Turbo Sloths is waiting!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/b8e9c38116e0e92ed210183702dcad24.poster.avif?t=1753370494\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/b8e9c38116e0e92ed210183702dcad24.webm?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443630/extras/b8e9c38116e0e92ed210183702dcad24.mp4?t=1753370494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2>",
    "short_description": "Turbo Sloths is an adrenaline-fueled shooter-racing game set on another planet, where you drive not a sports car, but a massive turbocharged truck turned into a war machine. Join the insane Wasteland League \u2014 here, it's not the fastest who wins, but the strongest.",
